    "summary": "Welcome to our place \u2013 Whakat\u0101ne, New Zealand. Where the people are as warm as the sea and air; surrounded by breath-taking landscapes and rich culture. Immerse yourself in a sense of freedom, take your time and stay a little longer. A place to explore, to unwind, to be. He tangata, he whenua, haere mai - our people, our place, welcome.\n\nVisit our website to find out more: http://www.whakatane.com",
